WEBVTT

00:00.647 --> 00:03.647
[upbeat island music]
[欢快的岛屿音乐]

00:03.647 --> 00:09.014
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:11.714 --> 00:14.580
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

00:14.580 --> 00:16.714
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

00:20.447 --> 00:22.314
- Ooh! Oh!
- 哦！哦！

00:22.314 --> 00:23.847
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

00:28.547 --> 00:29.880
Whoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼！

00:31.814 --> 00:33.714
- Hi.
- 你好。

00:33.714 --> 00:36.147
Gary, I feel funny inside.
加里，我内心觉得很有趣。

00:36.147 --> 00:37.947
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

00:40.347 --> 00:42.214
- Yow!
- 哟！

00:43.347 --> 00:44.480
Hello.
你好。

00:44.480 --> 00:47.147
- [shivering]
- [发抖]

00:47.147 --> 00:49.980
- Gary, there's something
inside of me.
- 加里，有件事
在我里面。

00:49.980 --> 00:51.214
- Meow.
- 喵。

00:51.214 --> 00:52.347
- You see anything?
- 你看到什么了吗？

00:53.447 --> 00:55.047
- [shivering]
- [发抖]

00:55.047 --> 00:57.247
- [screeches]
- [尖叫声]

00:57.247 --> 00:59.647
[screeching]
[尖叫声]

01:00.514 --> 01:02.247
- Uh-oh! Uh-oh! Oh!
- 呃哦！呃-哦！哦！

01:02.247 --> 01:03.814
- [screeching]
- [尖叫声]

01:05.080 --> 01:07.647
- Gary the Snail,
is that any way
- 蜗牛加里，
是这样吗

01:07.647 --> 01:09.814
to treat
an uninvited guest?
治疗
不速之客？

01:09.814 --> 01:12.514
Oh, hello.
哦，你好。

01:12.514 --> 01:14.414
Ooh! That tickles.
哦！那很痒。

01:14.414 --> 01:15.814
More like prickles.
更像是刺。

01:15.814 --> 01:18.547
Hey, I think I'll call you
Prickles.
嘿，我想我会打电话给你
刺。

01:18.547 --> 01:20.080
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

01:20.080 --> 01:22.314
- [laughs]
I see you.
- [笑]
我看到你了。

01:22.314 --> 01:23.814
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

01:23.814 --> 01:27.980
[babbling]
- [grunting]
[胡言乱语]
- [咕哝]

01:27.980 --> 01:29.814
- [babbles]
- [laughs] Okay, okay.
- [胡言乱语]
- [笑] 好吧，好吧。

01:29.814 --> 01:32.580
Enough's enough. It's time
for you to go, little guy.
够了够了。是时候了
让你走吧，小家伙。

01:32.580 --> 01:34.514
I already have a pet--
Gary.
我已经有宠物了——
加里.

01:34.514 --> 01:36.447
I'm afraid I just don't need
another one.
恐怕我只是不需要
另一个。

01:43.914 --> 01:46.814
Whew.
- [sobbing]
呼。
- [抽泣]

01:46.814 --> 01:49.380
- Aw, stop, stop!
- 噢，停下来，停下来！

01:49.380 --> 01:52.647
Oh, Gary, I don't like to hear
the little guy cry.
哦，加里，我不喜欢听
小家伙哭了。

01:52.647 --> 01:54.647
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:54.647 --> 01:58.447
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

01:59.814 --> 02:01.514
- Such a sad story.
- 多么悲伤的故事啊。

02:01.514 --> 02:03.947
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

02:03.947 --> 02:06.580
- Okay, little buddy,
but just for one night.
- 好吧，小伙子，
但只住一晚。

02:06.580 --> 02:07.980
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

02:10.214 --> 02:11.847
- Nighty night,
Prickles.
- 晚安的夜晚，
刺。

02:11.847 --> 02:13.380
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

02:13.380 --> 02:17.380
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

02:17.380 --> 02:18.814
[all snoring]
[全都打呼噜]

02:26.880 --> 02:27.880
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:27.880 --> 02:30.980
[techno music playing]
[电子音乐播放]

02:30.980 --> 02:34.847
[both babbling and cheering]
[胡言乱语和欢呼声]

02:34.847 --> 02:36.847
[blowing party horns]
[吹响派对号角]

02:36.847 --> 02:39.014
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:39.014 --> 02:40.214
[bike horn honks]
[自行车喇叭鸣响]

02:40.214 --> 02:44.447
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:44.447 --> 02:47.714
- Wow, a house party
going on of inside me.
- 哇，家庭聚会
我内心正在发生。

02:47.714 --> 02:49.080
Hey, why wasn't I invited?
嘿，为什么我没有被邀请？

02:49.080 --> 02:50.414
[laughs]
I guess I was,
[笑]
我想我是，

02:50.414 --> 02:51.947
since I am the house.
因为我就是房子。

02:51.947 --> 02:54.947
Look, Gary, now we have tons
of prickly new friends.
听着，加里，现在我们有很多
多刺的新朋友。

02:54.947 --> 02:56.814
- Meow, meow.
- 喵，喵。

02:56.814 --> 02:59.080
- Wup-poo. Wup-poo. Wup-poo.
- 呜呜。呜呜。呜呜。

03:01.814 --> 03:04.880
Wup-poo. Wup-poo.
Wup-poo. Wup-poo.
呜呜。呜呜。
呜呜。呜呜。

03:04.880 --> 03:06.447
[babbling]
[胡说]

03:06.447 --> 03:10.480
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:10.480 --> 03:11.680
Oh, my gosh!
哦，天哪！

03:11.680 --> 03:13.214
I completely lost
all track of time.
我彻底迷失了
所有的时间轨迹。

03:13.214 --> 03:14.814
Hey, uh, sorry to be
a party pooper, guys,
嘿，呃，抱歉
派对扫兴者，伙计们，

03:14.814 --> 03:17.480
but I've gotta take a shower
and get ready for work.
但我得去洗个澡
并准备好工作。

03:17.480 --> 03:19.914
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

03:19.914 --> 03:22.980
Guys?
Guy--guys?
伙计们？
盖伊——伙计们？

03:22.980 --> 03:25.147
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

03:25.147 --> 03:27.680
- Gary, calm down.
We're all friends here.
- 加里，冷静点。
我们都是这里的朋友。

03:27.680 --> 03:29.847
- [blows raspberry]
- [吹覆盆子]

03:29.847 --> 03:30.980
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

03:30.980 --> 03:33.247
[meowing]
[喵喵叫]

03:33.247 --> 03:34.647
- Ow!
- 噢！

03:34.647 --> 03:36.214
[gasps]
[groans]
[喘气]
[呻吟]

03:36.214 --> 03:39.147
Open up, Gary.
I'm still in my underwear.
开放，加里。
我还穿着内衣。

03:40.814 --> 03:43.314
Gary, I need to take
a shower.
加里，我需要采取
淋浴。

03:43.314 --> 03:44.447
Oh!
哦！

03:49.347 --> 03:51.680
- I did not need
to see that!
- 我不需要
看到那个！

03:51.680 --> 03:53.714
Ugh!
[grunts]
啊!
[咕哝]

03:53.714 --> 03:55.047
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

03:56.447 --> 03:57.880
Ahh!
啊！

03:57.880 --> 03:59.547
All right, I guess you guys
will just have to stay
好吧，我猜你们
只得留下来

03:59.547 --> 04:00.880
and go to work with me.
和我一起去上班。

04:00.880 --> 04:03.447
Just keep a low profile
or I could lose my job.
只是保持低调
否则我可能会失去工作。

04:04.614 --> 04:05.814
[whistles]
[口哨声]

04:05.814 --> 04:08.714
- Eh, SpongeBob.
Did ya clean out the--
- 呃，海绵宝宝。
你清理干净了吗——

04:08.714 --> 04:11.347
Sweet Dutchman's ghost!
可爱的荷兰人的鬼魂！

04:11.347 --> 04:14.147
When's the last time
you took a bath, boy-o?
最后一次是什么时候
你洗澡了吗，小伙子？

04:14.147 --> 04:15.647
You're riddled with vermin.
你身上充满了害虫。

04:15.647 --> 04:18.514
- I-I d-d-don't know
what you mean, sir.
- 我-我不知道
你的意思是，先生。

04:18.514 --> 04:19.814
[inhales]
[吸气]

04:19.814 --> 04:23.647
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:23.647 --> 04:26.147
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

04:26.147 --> 04:28.814
- If customers find out
you're touching patties
- 如果顾客发现
你在碰肉饼

04:28.814 --> 04:31.080
with your wormy hands,
用你长满虫子的手，

04:31.080 --> 04:34.014
the health department will
shut us down for sure.
卫生部门将
肯定会让我们关闭。

04:34.014 --> 04:35.814
- I understand, sir.
- 我明白了，先生。

04:35.814 --> 04:37.914
Mr. Krabs, will you excuse me
for a second?
蟹老板，请原谅我好吗？
一会儿？

04:37.914 --> 04:39.414
Prickles, you heard
my boss.
刺，你听到了吗
我的老板。

04:39.414 --> 04:41.080
I'm sorry, but I'm gonna
have to ask you
对不起，但我会
得问你

04:41.080 --> 04:43.380
and your friends to leave,
please.
和你的朋友离开，
请。

04:46.847 --> 04:48.814
"Squatters rights"?
“占屋者权利”？

04:48.814 --> 04:50.947
What the heck is
squatters rights?
到底是什么
擅自占地者的权利？

04:50.947 --> 04:53.614
- Oh, they're "lawyering" up,
boy-o.
- 哦，他们正在“打律师”，
男孩-o。

04:53.614 --> 04:56.814
They're makin' a legal claim
to keep living in your body.
他们正在提出法律索赔
继续住在你的身体里。

04:56.814 --> 04:59.714
- It's okay, Mr. Krabs,
they're not hurting me.
- 没关系，蟹老板先生，
他们没有伤害我。

04:59.714 --> 05:02.114
- Son, you gotta understand.
- 儿子，你必须明白。

05:02.114 --> 05:03.980
I can't have you work here
我不能让你在这里工作

05:03.980 --> 05:06.080
in your present
filthy "condisherin'."
在你现在的
肮脏的“歧视”。

05:07.247 --> 05:09.947
Oh!
That's the last straw!
哦！
那是最后一根稻草！

05:09.947 --> 05:11.914
Mr. Squid--
- On it, sir.
鱿鱼先生——
- 就这样吧，先生。

05:11.914 --> 05:14.614
Hasta la vista,
worm boy.
哈斯塔拉远景，
虫子男孩。

05:17.214 --> 05:19.814
- And don't come back
until you're dewormed!
- 并且不要回来
直到驱虫完毕！

05:19.814 --> 05:21.814
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

05:21.814 --> 05:23.714
- What am I gonna do?
- 我要做什么？

05:23.714 --> 05:24.914
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:24.914 --> 05:26.080
- Hey, SpongeBo--
Whoa!
- 嘿，海绵宝宝--
哇！

05:26.080 --> 05:28.347
I see you've got yourself
我看到你已经找到了自己

05:28.347 --> 05:30.147
a little problem
with the cooties.
有点问题
与虱子。

05:30.147 --> 05:32.847
- Yeah, and I lost
my job over it.
- 是的，我输了
我的工作就在于此。

05:32.847 --> 05:34.980
- Lost your job you say?
- 你说丢了工作？

05:34.980 --> 05:37.180
I might be able
to help you,
我也许可以
来帮助你，

05:37.180 --> 05:39.880
if you can do
something for me.
如果你能做到
给我的东西。

05:39.880 --> 05:42.347
- Anything, Plankton!
Anything!
- 任何事情，浮游生物！
任何事物！

05:43.680 --> 05:46.947
- [chuckles]
Ridding SpongeBob of his worms
- [轻笑]
消灭海绵宝宝身上的虫子

05:46.947 --> 05:49.347
will put him
forever in my debt.
会把他
永远欠我的债。

05:49.347 --> 05:51.880
That secret formula
is good as mine.
那个秘密配方
和我的一样好。

05:51.880 --> 05:54.180
[techno music playing]
[电子音乐播放]

05:54.180 --> 05:56.680
Time to crash
this lousy party.
崩溃的时间到了
这个糟糕的聚会。

05:56.680 --> 06:00.280
Get it? Lousy? Louse?
Oh, I'm good.
得到它？糟糕吗？虱？
哦，我很好。

06:00.280 --> 06:01.980
[roars]
[怒吼]

06:01.980 --> 06:05.547
[all grunting and fighting]
[所有的咕哝和打斗]

06:05.547 --> 06:07.980
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:07.980 --> 06:09.147
[laughs]
[笑]

06:09.147 --> 06:13.580
Whoa!
[babbling and fighting]
哇！
[胡言乱语和打斗]

06:13.580 --> 06:15.047
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:15.047 --> 06:18.547
[groans]
You're on your own, worm boy.
[呻吟]
你只能靠自己了，虫子男孩。

06:18.547 --> 06:20.414
[techno music playing]
[all babbling]
[电子音乐播放]
[全是胡言乱语]

06:22.014 --> 06:23.014
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:23.014 --> 06:27.147
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

06:27.147 --> 06:32.380
Ah! [groaning]
啊! [呻吟]

06:32.380 --> 06:33.280
- Hello?
- 你好？

06:33.280 --> 06:35.447
- You gotta help me!
- 你一定要帮我！

06:35.447 --> 06:38.580
- Ah! It's a monster
with SpongeBob's voice!
- 啊！这是一个怪物
海绵宝宝的声音！

06:38.580 --> 06:40.080
- No, no, Patrick, wait,
don't close the--
- 不，不，帕特里克，等等，
不要关闭--

06:40.080 --> 06:41.414
Aw!
噢！

06:41.414 --> 06:42.714
- [whistles]
- Hmm?
- [口哨]
- 嗯？

06:42.714 --> 06:45.547
Squidward. Squidward!
章鱼哥。章鱼哥！

06:45.547 --> 06:46.814
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

06:46.814 --> 06:47.814
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

06:47.814 --> 06:49.180
- I need a hug.
- 我需要一个拥抱。

06:49.180 --> 06:50.980
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

06:50.980 --> 06:52.114
[gasping]
[喘气]

06:52.114 --> 06:53.080
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:53.080 --> 06:54.814
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:58.280 --> 06:59.880
Does that mean no hug?
这是没有拥抱的意思吗？

06:59.880 --> 07:01.080
- There will be no hugs!
- 不会有拥抱！

07:01.080 --> 07:03.680
Get away from me,
you monstrosity!
离我远点，
你这个怪物！

07:03.680 --> 07:05.180
- [gagging]
- [作呕]

07:05.180 --> 07:07.814
[all humming]
[全部嗡嗡声]

07:07.814 --> 07:09.314
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:09.314 --> 07:11.314
[all humming]
- [groans]
[全部嗡嗡声]
- [呻吟]

07:13.947 --> 07:16.414
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

07:18.980 --> 07:20.814
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

07:22.214 --> 07:25.347
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

07:26.714 --> 07:28.247
[dance music playing]
[舞曲演奏]

07:28.247 --> 07:29.614
- [angry babbling]
- [愤怒的胡言乱语]

07:33.080 --> 07:35.414
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:35.414 --> 07:37.914
Well, this my life
from now on, huh?
好吧，这就是我的生活
从现在开始吧？

07:37.914 --> 07:39.114
[laughs]
[笑]

07:39.114 --> 07:40.814
Just call me
SpongeBob WormPants,
只要打电话给我
海绵宝宝蠕虫裤，

07:40.814 --> 07:44.147
'cause that's all I am,
just an apartment for worms.
因为这就是我的全部
只是蠕虫的公寓。

07:44.147 --> 07:49.614
[laughing]
[笑]

07:49.614 --> 07:51.580
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:51.580 --> 07:55.714
[all babbling and groaning]
[所有胡言乱语和呻吟]

07:57.247 --> 07:58.847
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

07:58.847 --> 08:00.514
[all babbling]
[全是胡言乱语]

08:00.514 --> 08:01.814
- [laughs]
- [笑]

08:01.814 --> 08:03.214
Oh, that's better.
哦，这样好多了。

08:03.214 --> 08:05.580
Looks like I really wormed
my way out of that one.
看来我真的驱虫了
我摆脱那个的方法。

08:05.580 --> 08:06.814
[laughs]
[笑]

08:06.814 --> 08:07.980
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

08:07.980 --> 08:10.247
Meow!
喵！

08:10.247 --> 08:13.514
- Gary, it feels so good
to be worm free.
- 加里，感觉真好
没有蠕虫。

08:13.514 --> 08:15.747
[techno music playing]
[all babbling]
[电子音乐播放]
[全是胡言乱语]

08:15.747 --> 08:19.047
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:19.047 --> 08:20.980
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:20.980 --> 08:24.447
SpongeBob!
I need a hug!
海绵宝宝！
我需要一个拥抱！

08:25.714 --> 08:28.714
[silly music]
[愚蠢的音乐]

08:28.714 --> 08:30.647
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:35.147 --> 08:36.147
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

08:36.147 --> 08:40.580
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

08:40.580 --> 08:42.180
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

08:43.647 --> 08:44.780
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

08:45.847 --> 08:47.614
Hmm?
唔？

08:47.614 --> 08:49.080
- [caws]
- [叫声]

08:49.080 --> 08:51.080
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

08:51.080 --> 08:53.014
- [caws]
- [叫声]

08:53.014 --> 08:53.980
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:53.980 --> 08:57.047
[babbling]
[胡说]

08:57.047 --> 08:58.480
[groans and pants]
[呻吟和裤子]

08:58.480 --> 09:00.880
Whew!
[grunts] Ahh.
哇！
[咕噜声]啊。

09:00.880 --> 09:03.980
- [cawing]
- [呱呱叫]

09:03.980 --> 09:05.314
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:06.580 --> 09:07.947
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:07.947 --> 09:09.814
- [babbles] Hmm.
- [胡言乱语] 嗯。

09:10.814 --> 09:11.814
- [caws]
- [screams]
- [叫声]
- [尖叫]

09:11.814 --> 09:13.480
- [snickers]
- [窃笑]

09:15.180 --> 09:16.514
